    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dexterity, your intellect, and every one of your senses <i>(yes, even <strong>Smell</strong>)</i> to rediscover the lost path to The Catacombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/7b01d3d9a4e8a9e491f059a52759c2d7.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers unique ways to explore. <strong>Feel</strong>\u00a0an object in shadow to find a hidden mechanism with typed commands. Leap to a precarious ledge in first-person to skip through pages in your book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/c42a7a1e4256623c8236b75d28bfa618.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abilities like <strong>Bind</strong> to warp between twin objects across worlds or <strong>Muse</strong> to unlock shortcuts and solve intriguing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/72dc1e394d83cecbbf557ab841a42639.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply interconnected world of tall towers, hidden pathways, and cryptic inner workings reveals its secrets to only the most resourceful adventurer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/f9b4b9de79ca94dc8351caa9c68b1d17.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your dexterity, your intellect, and every one of your senses <i>(yes, even <strong>Smell</strong>)</i> to rediscover the lost path to The Catacombs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/7b01d3d9a4e8a9e491f059a52759c2d7.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/1f46fde33e74d6146d4eaa6af633d029.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mode offers unique ways to explore. <strong>Feel</strong>\u00a0an object in shadow to find a hidden mechanism with typed commands. Leap to a precarious ledge in first-person to skip through pages in your book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/c42a7a1e4256623c8236b75d28bfa618.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/2320c97486c9f2447b1ebfe6471eb3b4.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find abilities like <strong>Bind</strong> to warp between twin objects across worlds or <strong>Muse</strong> to unlock shortcuts and solve intriguing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/72dc1e394d83cecbbf557ab841a42639.webp?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.poster.avif?t=1754612307\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.webm?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793810/extras/6799abd0b4f2a73e1665f118efffa524.mp4?t=1754612307\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply interconnected world of tall towers, hidden pathways, and cryptic inner workings reveals its secrets to only the most resourceful adventurer.</p>",
